{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function createQueuedState<TValue, TSelected>(\n   scope,\n   fn,\n   options?,\n   selector?): [() => TValue[], (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean, AlpineQueuer<TValue, TSelected>];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/alpine-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuedState.ts#L35","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queuer/createQueuedState.ts:35"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exposes pending queue items together with the queue that processes them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Retains accepted items until processing. Ordering, capacity, wait, and started options follow the underlying queue."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"return-value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Return value"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns [itemsAccessor, addItem, queue]. Call itemsAccessor() to read pending items."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"state-and-ownership","children":[{"type":"text","value":"State and ownership"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Items are selected by default. A custom selector must retain items and may add other state fields. The returned collection contains pending items; async active items are separate."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pass the owning PacerScope first, or call the method on that scope. Destroy the scope in the Alpine component's destroy method.\nOptions accept an object with top-level getters or an options factory. Function-valued core options remain callbacks. Local options override provider defaults without replacing the utility or its pending work.\nonUnmount replaces default cleanup and receives the utility instance. A custom callback must perform every needed cancel, stop, or abort action."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvalue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tselected","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Pick"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueuerState"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":">, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"items\""},{"type":"text","value":"> = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Pick"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueuerState"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":">, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"items\""},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"scope","children":[{"type":"text","value":"scope"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/PacerScope.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PacerScope"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"fn","children":[{"type":"text","value":"fn"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"item"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AlpinePacerOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AlpinePacerOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/AlpineQueuerOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AlpineQueuerOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">> = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"selector","children":[{"type":"text","value":"selector?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"[() => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":"[], ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"item"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"position?"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runOnItemsChange?"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/AlpineQueuer.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AlpineQueuer"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":">]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createQueuedState } from '@tanstack/alpine-pacer'\n\n// scope belongs to the current Alpine component.\nconst [items, addItem, queue] = createQueuedState(scope, (item: number) => { console.log(item) }, { wait: 500 })\naddItem(1)\nconsole.log(items())","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"see","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"createQueuer"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"return-value","text":"Return value","level":2},{"id":"state-and-ownership","text":"State and ownership","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"scope","text":"scope","level":3},{"id":"fn","text":"fn","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"selector","text":"selector?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"see","text":"See","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction createQueuedState<TValue, TSelected>(\n   scope,\n   fn,\n   options?,\n   selector?): [() => TValue[], (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean, AlpineQueuer<TValue, TSelected>];\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuedState.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/alpine-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuedState.ts#L35)\n\nExposes pending queue items together with the queue that processes them.\n\nRetains accepted items until processing. Ordering, capacity, wait, and started options follow the underlying queue.\n\n## Return value\n\nReturns [itemsAccessor, addItem, queue]. Call itemsAccessor() to read pending items.\n\n## State and ownership\n\nItems are selected by default. A custom selector must retain items and may add other state fields. The returned collection contains pending items; async active items are separate.\n\nPass the owning PacerScope first, or call the method on that scope. Destroy the scope in the Alpine component's destroy method.\nOptions accept an object with top-level getters or an options factory. Function-valued core options remain callbacks. Local options override provider defaults without replacing the utility or its pending work.\nonUnmount replaces default cleanup and receives the utility instance. A custom callback must perform every needed cancel, stop, or abort action.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` *extends* `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\> = `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### scope\n\n[`PacerScope`](../interfaces/PacerScope.md)\n\n### fn\n\n(`item`) => `void`\n\n### options?\n\n[`AlpinePacerOptions`](../type-aliases/AlpinePacerOptions.md)\\<[`AlpineQueuerOptions`](../interfaces/AlpineQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\> = `{}`\n\n### selector?\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n## Returns\n\n\\[() => `TValue`[], (`item`, `position?`, `runOnItemsChange?`) => `boolean`, [`AlpineQueuer`](../interfaces/AlpineQueuer.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\]\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { createQueuedState } from '@tanstack/alpine-pacer'\n\n// scope belongs to the current Alpine component.\nconst [items, addItem, queue] = createQueuedState(scope, (item: number) => { console.log(item) }, { wait: 500 })\naddItem(1)\nconsole.log(items())\n```\n\n## See\n\ncreateQueuer\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: createQueuedState\ntitle: createQueuedState\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction createQueuedState<TValue, TSelected>(\n   scope,\n   fn,\n   options?,\n   selector?): [() => TValue[], (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean, AlpineQueuer<TValue, TSelected>];\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuedState.ts:35](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/alpine-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuedState.ts#L35)\n\nExposes pending queue items together with the queue that processes them.\n\nRetains accepted items until processing. Ordering, capacity, wait, and started options follow the underlying queue.\n\n## Return value\n\nReturns [itemsAccessor, addItem, queue]. Call itemsAccessor() to read pending items.\n\n## State and ownership\n\nItems are selected by default. A custom selector must retain items and may add other state fields. The returned collection contains pending items; async active items are separate.\n\nPass the owning PacerScope first, or call the method on that scope. Destroy the scope in the Alpine component's destroy method.\nOptions accept an object with top-level getters or an options factory. Function-valued core options remain callbacks. Local options override provider defaults without replacing the utility or its pending work.\nonUnmount replaces default cleanup and receives the utility instance. A custom callback must perform every needed cancel, stop, or abort action.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` *extends* `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\> = `Pick`\\<`QueuerState`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"items\"`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### scope\n\n[`PacerScope`](../interfaces/PacerScope.md)\n\n### fn\n\n(`item`) => `void`\n\n### options?\n\n[`AlpinePacerOptions`](../type-aliases/AlpinePacerOptions.md)\\<[`AlpineQueuerOptions`](../interfaces/AlpineQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\> = `{}`\n\n### selector?\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n## Returns\n\n\\[() => `TValue`[], (`item`, `position?`, `runOnItemsChange?`) => `boolean`, [`AlpineQueuer`](../interfaces/AlpineQueuer.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\]\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { createQueuedState } from '@tanstack/alpine-pacer'\n\n// scope belongs to the current Alpine component.\nconst [items, addItem, queue] = createQueuedState(scope, (item: number) => { console.log(item) }, { wait: 500 })\naddItem(1)\nconsole.log(items())\n```\n\n## See\n\ncreateQueuer\n"}
